idas y hacer sacrificios definitivos para restaurar el equilibrio del universo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Ciencia ficción","Acción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/299534","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2019,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:17:08.765Z"},{"id":"movie-1197698","slug":"movie-1197698","title":"Cursed Waters","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aJMvmOLWLIU4SLwhoUP58YE42La.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Aventura","Fantasía","Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1197698","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:17:09.118Z"},{"id":"movie-1330021","slug":"movie-1330021","title":"Criaturas luminosas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/afCyi1YlcSq2BH14UJmFbqzzJ65.jpg","synopsis":"En este drama, basado en el bestseller homónimo, una viuda forja un vínculo con un pulpo muy listo y un joven a la deriva mientras trabaja de noche en un pequeño acuario.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Misterio"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1330021","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:17:09.469Z"},{"id":"movie-1375161","slug":"movie-1375161","title":"Don't Move","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uh0ZSdM8iOQgHwnUlhhanP8Dkl6.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1375161","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:17:09.816Z"},{"id":"movie-949838","slug":"movie-949838","title":"72 horas","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/enkyq1gVdQqWaCyAFjFIxjlKvNW.jpg","synopsis":"Para salvar su carrera, un ejecutivo publicitario de 40 años se une a unos veinteañeros en una alocada despedida de soltero en Miami cuando lo añaden por error a un chat grupal.","status":"Rel