:"movie-974236","title":"Made in EU","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/25YMkUSNzEjS42v3TWgCjF5ejoZ.jpg","synopsis":"Iva trabaja en una fábrica de ropa en la Bulgaria rural, luchando contra una enfermedad persistente pero misteriosa. Cuando se revela que es el primer caso de COVID en su pequeño pueblo, las noticias se convierten en una espiral interminable de acusaciones: primero de los dueños de la fábrica, deseosos de desviar la responsabilidad, luego de sus compañeros, su hijo y, finalmente, de toda la comunidad, a pesar de que Iva no ha salido del pueblo en años. A medida que aparecen las primeras víctimas del virus, la demonización pública de Iva se intensifica y rápidamente se convierte en una paria social.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/974236","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:19:16.414Z"},{"id":"movie-1599746","slug":"movie-1599746","title":"Un hiver russe","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6ABcfAIkwMTdi4NLnDaFPID3Olq.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Documental"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1599746","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:19:16.763Z"},{"id":"movie-1771989","slug":"movie-1771989","title":"Mitti De Putt","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/78fhdCL0SZhhSCOSBHxCRcJ1qD2.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Drama","Familia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1771989","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:19:17.113Z"},{"id":"movie-748681","slug":"movie-748681","title":"El Violinista","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v98Bn80fV3tFY32Z9D2BuFcll6u.jpg","synopsis":"Nos encontramos en Singapur, a finales de la década de 1930. Kai y Fei son amigos de la infancia y aspirantes a violinistas. Cuando Japón invade Malaya en 1941, Kai decide renunciar a su carrera musical para unirse a las fuerzas antijaponesas. Tras la guerra, Kai desaparece. Decidida a encontrarlo, Fei actúa por todo el Sudeste Asiático mientras busca cualquier noticia sobre él. Sin embargo, a medida que pasa el tiempo, Fei debe decidir si ha de encontrar su propia música para definir los años que le quedan de vida.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Drama","Música"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/748681","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:19:17.462Z"}],"seasons":[{"id":"movie-1742441-1","slug":"movie-1742441-1","seriesId":"movie-1742441","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1742441","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uS8yoiA6NfsuYeOTbVfpem8Ib9.jpg","episodeCount":1,"initialSyncComplete":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:28.766Z"},{"id":"movie-1545690-1","slug":"movie-1545690-1","seriesId":"movie-1545690","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545690","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRFDnH3XzwDKV9QU3DTYNU8XX2R.jpg","episodeCount":1,"initialSyncComplete":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:29.117Z"},{"id":"movie-1084244-1","slug":"movie-1084244-1","seriesId":"movie-1084244","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1084244","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pTjZfbFVWUIwUM5OzX3LVh84ejU.jpg","episodeCount":1,"initialSyncComplete":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:29.466Z"},{"id":"movie-1465063-1","slug":"movie-1465063-1","seriesId":"movie-1465063","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1465063","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vpTdXFoZGzwnCWzkVYU7JH8teAZ.jpg","episodeCount":1,"initialSyncComplete":true,"updatedAt":"2026-10-13T04:14:29.814Z"},{"id":"movie-1234139-1","slug":"movie-1234139-1","seriesId":"movie-1234139","sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1234139","number":1,"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lXOMsqKXVhEmPwthn